      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        90.99671936035156,
        527.43798828125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for  treatment regimen (2HRZ(E)/4HR), as per the existing recommendation from the 2014",
